                <pb facs="0526" n="490" xml:id="pg490"/>

                <head>Attachment 2<anchor n="6" xml:id="d199-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1967-05-20">May 20,
                    1967</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">SOVIET DRAFT TEXT</p>
                <p rendition="#center">ARTICLE III</p>
                <p>Each non-nuclear-weapon State Party to this Treaty undertakes to accept the
                    safeguards of the International Atomic Energy Agency on all its peaceful nuclear
                    activities. Each State Party to this Treaty further undertakes not to provide
                    source or fissionable material, or specialized equipment or non-nuclear material
                    for the processing or use of source or fissionable material or for the
                    production of fissionable material for peaceful purposes to any
                    non-nuclear-weapon State, unless such material and equipment are subject to such
                    safeguards.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
